#. type: Content of: <chapter><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/mailnews/mailnews.xml:10
#, xml-text
msgid "Mail/News Clients"
msgstr "Clientes de Mensagem/Notícias"

#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/mailnews/mailnews.xml:13
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Mail Clients help you retrieve (Fetchmail), sort (Procmail), read and "
"compose responses (Heirloom mailx, Mutt, Pine, Kmail, Balsa, Evolution, "
"SeaMonkey) to email."
msgstr ""
"Os Clientes de Mensagem te ajudam a recuperar (&quot;Fetchmail&quot;), "
"classificar (&quot;Procmail&quot;), ler e redigir respostas (&quot;Heirloom "
"mailx&quot;, &quot;Mutt&quot;, &quot;Pine&quot;, &quot;Kmail&quot;, "
"&quot;Balsa&quot;, &quot;Evolution&quot;, &quot;SeaMonkey&quot;) para "
"mensagem eletrônica."

#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/mailnews/mailnews.xml:19
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"News clients also help you retrieve, sort, read and compose responses, but "
"these messages travel through USENET (a worldwide bulletin board system) "
"using the Network News Transfer Protocol (NNTP)."
msgstr ""
"Os clientes de notícias também te ajudam a recuperar, classificar, ler e "
"redigir respostas, mas essas mensagens viajam pela &quot;USENET&quot; (um "
"sistema mundial de boletim informativo) usando o &quot;Network News Transfer"
" Protocol&quot; (&quot;NNTP&quot;)."
